{title: Tera Zikr}
{artist: Darshan Raval}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Abhi abhi to mile [G] the,        Phir [F] juda ho [G] gaye
Kya [Am] thi meri [G] khataa,        Tum [F] sazaa ho [G] gaye
Mujhe [Am] khone ke baad ik [G] din,        Tum mujhe [F] yaad karo [G] ge
Phir [Am] dekhna milne ki [G] mujhse,        Tum [F] fariyaad [G] karoge
Mujhe [Am] khone ke baad ik [G] din,        Tum mujhe [F] yaad karo [G] ge
Phir [Am] dekhna milne ki [G] mujhse,        Tum [F] fariyaad [G] karoge
[Am] Mulakatein [G] adhoori rahi,        [Em] Mukammal karunga ye [F] waada raha
[Am] Tanhaaiyon se [G] bhi main teri,        [Em] Baatein karunga yeh [F] waada raha
Tera [Am] zikr jisme [G] hua na ho,        Mere [Em] paas aisa [F] lamha na ho
Maine [Am] jisme tujhko [G] maanga nahi,        Mere [Em] lab pe aisi [F] dua na ho
[E] Bakhuda,        Mujhe [Am] khone ke baad ik [G] din
Tum mujhe [F] yaad karo [G] ge,        Phir [Am] dekhna milne ki [G] mujhse
Tum [F] fariyaad [G] karoge,        Mujhe [Am] khone ke baad ik [G] din
